      <li class='mt-2'><b>Interactive Learning Platforms And Software:</b>There are various platforms and software available for a comprehensive educational environment. These platforms often integrate educational games, learning and teaching videos And others digital resources. This helps children to learn on their own. These Software and platforms offer a variety of activities, lessons, and quiz tests. These platforms cater to learning styles and help children engage and be motivated.</li>

